---
import V5Layout from '../layouts/V5Layout.astro';
const title = "For Explorers - Where to drill next, and what it costs | AiRE";
const description = "Turn the exploration data you already paid for into your next drill program. Fixed-scope AI targeting for junior and mid-tier miners - from a 48-hour Prospect Brief to full portfolio programs.";
const bodyHtml = "\n\n<main>\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">/explorer \u00b7 for miners &amp; juniors</p>\n    <h1>Your next drill program is hiding in data you already paid for.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Most juniors are sitting on years of surveys, geochemistry and imagery that were interpreted once and shelved. AiRE re-reads all of it - together, against current deposit science - and returns ranked targets you can take to the board, the market and the rig.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">The problem we solve</p>\n      <h2>Every dollar you spend on drilling is a bet on an interpretation.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">AiRE makes that interpretation multi-evidence, literature-current, independently audited - and honest about its own blind spots. You see exactly which evidence supports each target, and exactly what your data could not test.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feature-cols\">\n      <div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"f-ic\">\u25c8</div><h3>All your evidence, one verdict</h3><p>Satellite alteration mapping, magnetics, radiometrics, geochemistry and historical drilling - scored together by twelve literature-calibrated deposit models, not interpreted in silos.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"f-ic\">\u25c8</div><h3>Weeks, not field seasons</h3><p>A full-tenement targeting run on existing data takes weeks. The processing itself runs at 2-5 minutes per 100 km\u00b2. The slow part is the rigour, and that's the part you want slow.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"f-ic\">\u25c8</div><h3>Built for your investors too</h3><p>Deliverables arrive prospectus-ready: maps with cited methods, 3D models your board can fly through, and disclosure language your QP will accept.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Engagement tiers</p>\n      <h2>Start at $1,999. Scale when the geology earns it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">No discovery-call roulette. Three fixed shapes of engagement, each with a defined deliverable.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tier-grid\">\n      <article class=\"tier reveal\">\n        <h3>Prospect Brief</h3>\n        <p class=\"t-price\">US$1,999</p>\n        <p class=\"t-turn\">48-hour turnaround</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Data inventory &amp; quality assessment</li>\n          <li>Applicable deposit-model framework</li>\n          <li>Preliminary prospectivity read</li>\n          <li>Fixed-price scope for a full run</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-line\" href=\"/engage\">Start here</a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"tier tier-feature reveal\">\n        <span class=\"t-flag\">Most engaged</span>\n        <h3>Project Intelligence</h3>\n        <p class=\"t-price\">from US$14,999</p>\n        <p class=\"t-turn\">Delivered in weeks</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Full CAGE-IN multi-evidence run</li>\n          <li>One deposit-model family, up to ~100 km\u00b2</li>\n          <li>Ranked targets + score rasters + sections</li>\n          <li>Interactive 3D deposit/terrain viewer</li>\n          <li>Coverage &amp; confidence disclosure</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/engage\">Scope my project</a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"tier reveal\">\n        <h3>Portfolio Program</h3>\n        <p class=\"t-price\">from US$69,999</p>\n        <p class=\"t-turn\">Multi-tenement \u00b7 ongoing</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Multiple tenements &amp; deposit models</li>\n          <li>Full AiRE Council engagement</li>\n          <li>Quarterly re-scoring as science updates</li>\n          <li>Drill-program support &amp; target iteration</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-line\" href=\"/engage\">Talk portfolios</a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"indicative-note\">Pricing is indicative and confirmed in the fixed-price scope that accompanies every Prospect Brief. Complex data conditions are priced before work begins - never discovered after.</p>\n    <p class=\"indicative-note\">Consulting on a project for a client? AiRE runs <b>white-label</b> - your brand and your sign-off, our targeting engine behind the deliverable.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap-narrow\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">What we need from you</p>\n    <h2>If you can export it, we can score it.</h2>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><h3>Whatever exists - in any state</h3><p>Drill databases, geochem sheets, geophysics grids, old consultant reports, GIS projects. Messy is normal; the data-quality review is part of the job, and problems are reported to you, not silently patched.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><h3>Your target concept, if you have one</h3><p>If you believe it's an orogenic gold system, we'll test that - and we'll also tell you if the evidence votes for something else.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"s-num\"></div><div><h3>Confidentiality, by default</h3><p>Your data stays yours. NDAs welcome. Nothing appears in our public materials without written consent - and credentials never live in our code or outputs.</p></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fly-cta\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/engage\">Get the 48-Hour Prospect Brief <span class=\"arr\">\u2192</span></a>\n      <p class=\"micro\">US$1,999 \u00b7 48 hours \u00b7 the beginning of every AiRE engagement</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<div class=\"spine-band\"><div class=\"wrap\"><p class=\"spine\">We don&rsquo;t add to your data pile - we <span class=\"hl\">resolve it into a ranked drill decision you can sign and defend.</span></p></div></div>\n\n";
---
<V5Layout title={title} description={description}>
<Fragment set:html={bodyHtml} />
</V5Layout>
